OL,3,GNEWSATed Lasso mimics Delia's 'let's be
OL,4,Ahaving you' rant
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Norwich City fans, it's a familiar
OL,7,Frallying cry.
OL,9,FFor global fans of Ted Lasso, the Apple
OL,10,FTV+ comedy drama following a US coach
OL,11,Fmanaging an English side, not so much.
OL,13,FIn 2005, Delia Smith took to the pitch
OL,14,Fat half-time, grabbed a microphone and,
OL,15,Fto everyone's shock, angrily hollered
OL,16,F"where are you?" at Norwich supporters.
OL,18,FThe infamous rant at Carrow Road by the
OL,19,FCanaries' majority shareholder has now
OL,20,Fbeen celebrated in the TV show from
OL,21,Facross the pond.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
